    <div id="main-content" role="main" class="content__main">
      <h1>  Housing Rates
</h1>
        <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class="hidden"></div><div class="body__container">
  <h3>Reduced Rate Program</h3>

<p>CSUN Student Housing has launched the&nbsp;Reduced Rate Program. &nbsp;Through this program, a limited number of eligible student residents&nbsp;can qualify for reduced rate.&nbsp;</p>

<p><a class="link" data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f6994d5a-d162-4fda-bea0-3cfb5a45018f" href="/housing/resources/reduced-rate-program" title="Reduced Rate Program">Learn more about the Reduced Rate Program</a></p>

  <hr />

      <h2>2026-2027 Rates</h2>


    <div class="accordion">
          <h2 class="accordion__heading"><button class="accordion__toggle" aria-expanded="false">  The Park Apartments and Suites Academic Year 2026-2027: August 22, 2026 to May 15, 2027
</button></h2>
  <div class="accordion__content">
    <h2>The Park Apartments and Suites 2026-2027</h2>

<p>The fees below reflect charges for students who move in between August 22 and August 29, 2026, and stay until May 15, 2027. Charges are pro-rated for students moving in after August 29st, 2026. This is an installment payment plan, not monthly rent. Students who vacate due to an approved release of the license agreement will be charged on a pro-rated basis.</p>

<p><strong>Initial Payment:&nbsp;</strong>A non-refundable processing fee of $50 is due with your license agreement. The initial payment may be made online during the application process.&nbsp; The $50 processing fee is non-refundable even if the license agreement is approved for cancellation.</p>

<p><strong>Monthly Installment Plan:&nbsp;</strong>Charges will be posted to your <strong>CSUN Student Account</strong>, which can be viewed at your <a href="https://portal.csun.edu/login" title="CSUN Portal"><strong>CSUN Portal</strong></a> account (not Student Housing Portal), and are due according to the following schedule. Payments received after the 10th&nbsp;of each month will accrue a late fee of $15 on the 11th&nbsp;day. Contact the Student Housing Office to make special arrangements to make payment in full for the semester or the entire academic year.</p>

<table>
	<thead>
		<tr>
			<th>Dates Due</th>
			<th>Apartment Double with Kitchen</th>
			<th>Apartment Double without Kitchen</th>
			<th>Suite Double without Kitchen</th>
		</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td>Initial Payment</td>
			<td>$50</td>
			<td>$50</td>
			<td>$50</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>July 17, 2026</td>
			<td>$1,256</td>
			<td>$1,011</td>
			<td>$973</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>September 1, 2026</td>
			<td>$1,256</td>
